{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biblically Inaccurate is an ancient roman themed subversive endless runner, that flips the genre on its head. You play as a guardian angel that has been tasked with protecting the runner from impending death.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evoke the Roman Pantheon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of ancient roman gods and godesses, Jupiter, Mars, Neptune and others to turn the tides.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everchanging Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across beautifully drawn, procedurally generated terrains that change with each start of the level so you can never predict the order.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibrant Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eye-catching full colour animations and cutscenes, gorgeous parallax backgrounds and detailed game assets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044520?t=1771898958","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044520?t=1771898958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044520/88b964f75bc8c5dc12411939bec42cc54ba0694b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771898958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044520/88b964f75bc8c5dc12411939bec42cc54ba0694b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771898958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biblically Inaccurate is an ancient roman themed subversive endless runner, that flips the genre on its head. You play as a guardian angel that has been tasked with protecting the r